    "Prior to first occupation of the development, details of how 15 cycle parking spaces minimum, shall be submitted and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The development shall be completed and retained in accordance with these approved details.\n\nReason: In order to ensure that satisfactory provision is made to accommodate cycles within the site, and to accord with Policy 6.13 of the London Plan and Policy LP23 of the Council's Local Plan."
